italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">message()\n                 </span><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"> overrides parent function to display the text \"Using messaging of </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">name</span><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">\" \n                  (where </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">name </span><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">is the value in variable </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">name</span><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">)\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">        main()</span><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">\n                  </span><span style=\"font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">main() </span><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">will do the following:\n                  1. Create an object of </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Messaging</span><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"> and call its </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">message()</span><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"> function.\n                  2. Ask user to input a social media </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">name</span><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">. \n                  3. Create an object </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">SocialMedia(name)</span><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"> and call its </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">message() </span><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">function.\n</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">SocialMedia </span><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">will initialise variable </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">name </span><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">from an input when an object is created.\n</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Run </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">SocialMedia.main()</span><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">.\n</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Follow the test output display format and comment your codes.</span></p><div><u segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\",=\"\" emoji\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 16px;=\"\" white-space:=\"\" normal;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Test Input</span></u><br></div><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Instagram\n</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Discord\n</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Facebook</span></p><p><u segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"